# Context7 MCP Skill

**Server:** context7  
**URL:** https://mcp.context7.com/mcp  
**Auth:** CONTEXT7_API_KEY (headers)

## When to use

- Looking up latest docs for libraries, frameworks, or languages
- Verifying API signatures, config options, or migration guides
- Researching best practices or official examples before implementing
- Resolving "how does X work in library Y?" questions

## Usage

Reference this skill with `@mcp-skills/context7` when you need up-to-date documentation. Prefer Context7 over generic web search for technical, library-specific questions.

## Notes

- Use for framework docs (React, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, etc.) and language references.
- Per project rules: use indexed docs first, then Context7, then web.
